              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains an overview of the Top 50 Topics per number of (funded) publications, for the World, and the Top 50 Topics for EU-27 plus the 5 selected knowledge economies. These Top 50 Topics are compared to the EC funded Topics to show the differences in productivity (i.e. World vs EC, and EU-27 plus 5 vs EC). \nThis is a simplified overview of earlier data shared, which shows similar data but then for all 23755 Topics. These can be found in dataset; https://doi.org/10.34894/KQRWEN and dataset: https://doi.org/10.34894/DNWIXV. Note: the World is defined by 180 countries and territories that have produced output in the 23755 topics."
                },
